/-- **Theorem 9.4, universal annihilator.** The actual comparison obstruction is annihilated for every poset of the rank bound and every automorphism action. The proof also includes rank zero, where the family is the scalar identity. -/
theorem theorem_9_4_universalAnnihilator (d : ℕ) (hrank : ∀ p : P, faceRank p ≤ d) :
    ((d - 1).factorial : K) • comparisonObstruction K hs act h₁ hmul = 0 := by sorry
